# A triggered ability's targets are checked again as it resolves (CR 608.2b) by its own text, fixed as it was put on the
# stack (CR 603.3, 113.7a). The Warg deals combat damage to Bot2 and its trigger goes on the stack in the counter mode,
# targeting the only Wolf Bot1 controls, itself. In response Artificial Evolution replaces Wolf with Elf in the Warg's text,
# its type line included: the Warg is an Elf now. The ability still says "target Wolf you control", so its one target is
# illegal and it does nothing: the Warg gets no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Bejeweled Warg
Artificial Evolution
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
