Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bejeweled Warg.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Bejeweled Warg)
Bot1.Modes(Put a +1/+1 counter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Bejeweled Warg)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Wolf)
Bot1.Modes(Elf)
? Stack.Count = 1
